  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **old quen cole**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **deez nuts**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2000-06-23** (recommended): source not stated; 36 songs; 155 min [1]\n- **ween2000-06-23.prodigital**: source not stated; 0 songs; 172 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The uploader says this was their first Ween show, and the taping covered two nights at the venue [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2000-06-23**: taped by Spencer Hamlin, Michael Stern, Deesher; source: Dat [1]. Also: Taped on a friend's DAT recorder, with help from two others, Spencer Hamlin and Michael Stern named as involved; Their own microphones were poor, so another taper with a better setup let them plug into his equipment on both nights [1]",
